Unknown, malformed and path-like segment names are dropped, and an unknown theme falls back to the default
-- input.json --
{"model":{"display_name":"Opus 4.7"},"effort":{"level":"high"},"session_id":"abc123"}
-- config --
segments = model bogus Bad-Name ../x model
theme = nonexistent
-- output --
Opus 4.7 [high] \e[2m·\e[0m Opus 4.7 [high]
